{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37242","headline":"陪浙西王侍郎夜宴 · 章谒","name":"陪浙西王侍郎夜宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深锁雷门宴上才，旋看歌舞旋传杯。\n黄金鸂鶒当筵睡，红锦蔷薇影烛开。\n稽岭好风吹玉佩，镜湖残月照楼台。\n小儒末座频倾耳，祗怕城头画角催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}